  "notes": "{採掘|さいくつ} refers specifically to mining or extracting natural resources from the earth for commercial purposes.\n\nWRITING:\n- {採|さい} (gather, collect, take)\n- {掘|くつ} (dig)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {採掘|さいくつ}する (to mine - suru verb)\n- {採掘|さいくつ}{権|けん} (mining rights)\n- {採掘|さいくつ}{場|じょう} (mining site)\n\nCOMMON OBJECTS:\n- {石炭|せきたん}の{採掘|さいくつ} (coal mining)\n- {金|きん}の{採掘|さいくつ} (gold mining)\n- {石油|せきゆ}の{採掘|さいくつ} (oil extraction)\n- {鉱石|こうせき}の{採掘|さいくつ} (ore mining)\n- {天然|てんねん}ガスの{採掘|さいくつ} (natural gas extraction)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {発掘|はっくつ}: archaeological excavation or talent discovery\n- {採掘|さいくつ}: commercial extraction of natural resources\n- {掘削|くっさく}: drilling (often for oil/gas wells)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {発掘|はっくつ} (excavation - archaeological)\n- {掘削|くっさく} (drilling, excavation)\n- {鉱山|こうざん} (mine)\n- {鉱業|こうぎょう} (mining industry)",
